  m_text: 'Lobe Name: Hippocampus


    Location: Located deep within the Temporal
    Lobe (Pull the brain apart to see!)


    Function: Formation of long-term memories
    and spatial navigation


    Clinical Relevance: This area is often the first
    to be damaged in conditions that cause severe memory loss (e.g Alzheimer''s).

'
